  alt_text: "Cutouts on a clear sheet: the math card above a sideways cutout reading I make some things LOOK EASY, Caveat, 13 years building Skill domain, 9 years building Professional Webshit, Learn Midjourney, Learn Adobe, Learn JetBrains"
